 on the importance  of family latino history is american  history and without our story being told  so that people in this country and  people in the world can see how  beautiful our country is and what we  contribute as latinos i think it's going  to help tell the story of a more perfect  union the momentum behind this is just  critical  it it it's critical and it's critical  that we pass that on i cannot wait to  take my children  for cbs mornings i'm ed o'keefe  in washington  i'm so glad they're doing that i love mr  diaz when he said  it's a chance for people to get to know  us a little better yeah and latino  history is american history i think it's  so important that this is happening  that's right shout out to all of our  latino brothers and sisters including ed  o'keefe don't be fooled by the last name  no doubt about it and that that museum  will be a reflection  of how much they are appreciated in this  country and around the world and the  difference they made yeah no doubt about  it and then your five dollars

